{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 6, :comments ["<b>נשקפתי</b> — These are the words of Solomon. Its meaning: I revealed myself and was seen by those who look at me, so that people will rejoice in seeing him. Similarly <b>נשקפה ותיבב</b>. The meaning of the nifal <b>הנשקף</b> is to show oneself, and the hifil <b>המשקיף</b> is to look at others."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 7, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:21:16.455807333Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}